    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3101</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;。
てめぇの思念を感知する装置は
壊れてんだな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Kunzite&gt;. You said your
function to sense Will is broken, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7648</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3102</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。
１７０年前のインカローズ戦で
破壊され、修復は不可能</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. It was destroyed in a battle
against Incarose 170 years ago,
and is unable to be repaired.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>7992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3103</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だが他のセンサーは有効だ。
視覚内の物体のデータを取得可能。
&lt;Ines&gt;を目視した場合——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, many other sensors remain operational.
I am able to gather data on objects within my vision.
I shall demonstrate using &lt;Ines&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8444</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3104</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>胸囲　２．６ワース。
胴回り１．７２ワース。
腰回り２．５２ワース</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Bust measurement: 2.6 warth.
Waist measurement: 1.72 warth.
Hip measurement: 2.52 warth.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>8796</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3105</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉっ、そんなステキな機能が!?
……けど、『ワース』って
なんだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa, what a sick feature!
...But uh, what’s a “warth?”</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9220</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3106</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>結晶界で使用される単位だ。
原界の赤道半径をワースで
表記すると</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is a unit of measurement used on Quartzia.
If the equatorial radius of Celland were
measured in warth, it would equate to... </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9344</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3107</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>１８２２万
３２８５．７５ワース。
換算は自ら実行せよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>18,223,285.75 warth.
I leave the calculations to you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9512</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C3108</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ、赤道半径って
確か————??</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uhh, so if the equatorial radius​ is...
Nnngh?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
